sequenceDiagram
    participant Participant
    participant Filter as FAPI-Brazil / mTLS + DPoP
    participant Consent as Consent Service
    participant Receipt as Consent Receipt (ES256)
    participant Discovery as Resource Discovery
    participant Policy as Policy Engine
    participant Context as Authorized Context
    participant Planner as Extraction Planner (DAG)
    participant Temporal as Temporal Engine

    Participant->>Filter: POST /api/v1/open-finance/consents (mTLS + DPoP)
    Filter->>Consent: Criar consentimento (AES-256-GCM at rest)
    Consent->>Receipt: Emitir recibo assinado (ES256)
    Consent-->>Participant: 201 Created (consentId, v1)
    Participant->>Consent: Autorizar consentimento (AUTHORISED)
    Consent->>Discovery: Descobrir grafo de recursos (ConsentGrantedEvent)
    Discovery->>Policy: Avaliar recursos autorizados (INV-001, INV-002)
    Policy->>Context: Emitir AuthorizedContext imutável assinado (INV-005)
    Context->>Planner: Gerar ExecutionPlan DAG (consent-to-execution)
    Planner->>Temporal: Iniciar DataExtractionWorkflow + ConsentMonitoringWorkflow
    Temporal-->>Participant: Workflows em execução
